    Forge display strings - German.

    Translated from the English source file. Terms flagged for a native-speaker review are listed
    in docs/localization/adding-a-locale.md; "Imperial" is kept because German fitness apps use
    the English term, but it is the one entry here worth a second opinion rather than a guess.

    Every key present in ForgeStrings.resx must be present here. A key that is missing falls back
    to English rather than rendering blank, and ForgeStringResourcesTests fails the build so the
    gap is never silent.
  -->
